# NYC Airbnb Price Prediction — DS4420 Final Project

**Authors:** Meixu Chen & Yuetong Yin  
**Course:** DS4420 Machine Learning/Data Mining 2, Spring 2026  
**Instructor:** Dr. Eric Gerber, Northeastern University

## App structure

Two pages:
1. **Overview** — project background, dataset stats, model cards, key findings, comparison table
2. **Model Explorer** — three interactive tabs:
   - Metric comparison (bar chart, selectable metric)
   - Actual vs predicted scatter (toggle models on/off)
   - Bayesian posterior coefficients (with 95% credible interval toggle)

## Local setup

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
streamlit run app.py
```

## Deploy to Streamlit Community Cloud (free, ~2 min)

1. Push this folder to a **public GitHub repo**
2. Go to https://share.streamlit.io → Sign in with GitHub → **New app**
3. Select your repo, branch `main`, file path `app.py`
4. Click **Deploy** — done!

Your app will be live at `https://<your-app-name>.streamlit.app`

## Deploy to Hugging Face Spaces (alternative)

1. Create a new Space at https://huggingface.co/spaces
2. Choose **Streamlit** as the SDK
3. Upload `app.py` and `requirements.txt`
4. The Space builds automatically

## Files

```
app.py              # Main Streamlit application
requirements.txt    # Python dependencies
README.md           # This file
```
